.TH KROUTON 1 "November 2026" "Krouton 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
krouton \- burn, inspect and plan CD, DVD and Blu-ray discs from the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B krouton
.RI [ subcommand ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B krouton
is the command-line side of Krouton, a macOS app for data discs, audio CDs, disc images and
disc labels. Run without arguments, it opens the app. Run with a subcommand, it works in the
terminal and opens no window.
.PP
Add
.B \-\-json
to
.BR drives ,
.BR formats ,
.B inspect
and
.B span
for output a script can read.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.BR drives " [" \-\-json ]
List connected burners: model, firmware, connection and the disc in each.
.TP
.BR formats " [" \-\-json ]
List every kind of disc Krouton can make and the disc sizes each allows.
.TP
.BI inspect " image " "\fR[\fB\-\-sha256\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR]"
Describe an .iso, .dmg, .bin or .cue image: whether it boots (El Torito, Apple Partition Map),
its file systems and its size in 2048-byte sectors.
.B \-\-sha256
also prints its SHA-256 checksum.
.TP
.BI span " \fR[\fB\-\-medium \fIsize\fR] " files... " \fR[\fB\-\-json\fR]"
Plan how files would be split across discs of one size:
.BR cd650 ", " cd700 ", " cd800 ", " minidvd ", " dvd5 ", " dvd9 ", " bd25 ", " bd50 ", " bdxl100 " or " bdxl128 .
.TP
.BI "iso \-V " title " \-o " output.iso " " folder
Build a hybrid UDF, ISO 9660 and Joliet image from a folder.
.TP
.BI completions " zsh\fR|\fPbash\fR|\fPfish"
Print a tab-completion script for the shell.
.TP
.BR \-\-version ", " \-v
Print the version.
.TP
.BR \-\-help ", " \-h
Print a summary of the subcommands.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, non-zero when the subcommand fails or its arguments are wrong.
.SH EXAMPLES
Check a downloaded image against the checksum on its website:
.PP
.RS
krouton inspect ~/Downloads/debian.iso \-\-sha256
.RE
.PP
See how many Blu-ray discs a folder needs:
.PP
.RS
krouton span \-\-medium bd25 ~/Pictures/2025
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/Library/Application Support/app.krouton
Sessions and settings of the Krouton app.
.TP
.I ~/Music/Krouton Rips
Audio CDs ripped in the app.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hdiutil (1),
.BR drutil (1)
.PP
The Krouton manual: https://krouton.app/manual/
.SH BUGS
Report problems at https://github.com/jigaz/Krouton/issues.
